abstract: >-
  Prices, 24-hour volume and results for prediction markets on Polymarket,
  Kalshi, Manifold, Myriad, Limitless, Predict, Opinion, Gemini, Hyperliquid,
  MNX, Seer and XO Market, served through a read-only API, an MCP server,
  nightly bulk files and a public read-only Postgres database.
